          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1860
        },
        {
          "text": "“The question is whether you’re wearing this because you want to or because you’re trying to prove something.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2066
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme smiled. “Then stop staring at yourself like you’re waiting for permission.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2224
